# Test Name: 76165 Fusion - Wizz Air - Baggage allowance correctly reflects selected baggage when ancillaries include own baggage
# Status: Design
# Labels: AutoGenerated,Baggage,E2E-Pipeline,Flights,Fusion
# Tests: Bug #72524 - Fusion - Wizz Air - Baggage allowance display when selecting baggage + ancillaries that include baggage
#
# Selecting 2 x 26kg bags and then the priority boarding + 2 cabin bags ancillary option (which
# carries its own baggage) made the quote's baggage allowance read "2Pc 32kg+32kg" instead of the
# bags the user actually chose.
#
# Travelfusion now labels that ancillary "Personal Item ... + Hand Luggage ... / 1 bag max 10Kg +
# Speedy Boarding", and the baggage option "2 bags - 26Kg+26Kg - <price>". Baggage is bought for the
# outbound leg only, so the inbound leg keeps the Wizz Go fare's own allowance.

@regression @flights @fusion @provider:travelfusion @baggage @ancillaries @priority:critical
Feature: 76165 Fusion Wizz Air - Baggage allowance correctly reflects selected baggage when ancillaries include baggage

  Scenario: Baggage allowance displays selected 2x26kg after adding ancillary with its own baggage
    Given I am logged in as "wizzAir@TFreg.club" booking a new trip
    And I have added myself as the traveler
    When I search for a round trip flight from "FCO" to "BUD"
    And I filter results by carrier "Wizz Air"
    And I click to open first pricing options
    And I select the pricing option containing "Wizz Go"
    And I select the pricing option containing "Wizz Go"
    And I add to trip from pricing options
    Then the booking status should be "Pending booking"
    When I click to edit the baggage extras section
    And I click number of baggage
    And I click dropdown option "2 bags - 26Kg+26Kg"
    And I click the save button
    Then the visible baggage green icon should be visible
    When I select ancillary option "Speedy Boarding"
    And I click the save button
    Then the ancillary options filled indicator should be visible
    When I click to edit the baggage extras section
    Then the baggage option "2 bags - 26Kg+26Kg" should be saved
    Then the outbound baggage allowance in the quote should display "26Kg+26Kg"
